            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Westbrook DHS - Eligibility Timeliness & Equity\n",
                "\n",
                "**The event** — federal law gives SNAP **30 days** to decide (7 if expedited), Medicaid 45. Statewide Westbrook hits ~84%. **Tamarack County** lost its paper mill and 3 of 7 caseworkers — its on-time rate has collapsed to under 30% over the last 3 months.\n",
                "\n",
                "**What to see** — Tamarack's line (red) falls away from every other county after May · its open cases per worker (red) dwarf the rest of the state · the equity gap is **geographic**, not demographic (page 2)."
              ]
            }
